+##     .subckt pureg A
+##     XMREAL net1 pmodel
+##     **** begin user architecture code
+##     .subckt helper a b
+##     Rh a b 1k
+##     .ends
+##     **** end user architecture code
+##     XMAFTER net2 pmodel
+##     .ends
